    "scope": "“All the people” in 15:8 could mean all whom Saul’s army met, and survivors or other Amalekite groups are not ruled out by the wording. The record does not claim that 15:8 says no Amalekite was left alive anywhere. The Hebrew quoted is the Westminster Leningrad Codex digital text; a digital named edition is not proof that every manuscript agrees.",
