    "status": "Textual conflict",
    "summary": "2 Kings 8:25 has Ahaziah begin to reign in the twelfth year of Joram of Israel. 9:29 has him begin in the eleventh.",
    "text": "KJV 2 Kings 8:25: “In the twelfth year of Joram the son of Ahab king of Israel did Ahaziah the son of Jehoram king of Judah begin to reign.” Hebrew (WLC) 8:25: בִּשְׁנַת֙ שְׁתֵּים־עֶשְׂרֵ֣ה שָׁנָ֔ה לְיֹורָ֥ם בֶּן־אַחְאָ֖ב [in the twelfth year of Joram son of Ahab]. KJV 9:29: “And in the eleventh year of Joram the son of Ahab began Ahaziah to reign over Judah.” Hebrew (WLC) 9:29: וּבִשְׁנַת֙ אַחַ֣ת עֶשְׂרֵ֣ה שָׁנָ֔ה לְיֹורָ֖ם בֶּן־אַחְאָ֑ב [and in the eleventh year of Joram son of Ahab]. Septuagint (Brenton Greek) 8:25: Ἐν ἔτει δωδεκάτῳ τῷ Ἰωρὰμ [in the twelfth year of Joram]. Brenton Greek 9:29: Καὶ ἐν ἔτει ἑνδεκάτῳ Ἰωρὰμ [and in the eleventh year of Joram]. Fetched from https://bolls.life/get-text/WLC/12/8/, https://bolls.life/get-text/WLC/12/9/, https://ebible.org/grcbrent/2KI08.htm and https://ebible.org/grcbrent/2KI09.htm.",
