    "text": "KJV 2 Kings 24:8: “Jehoiachin was eighteen years old when he began to reign, and he reigned in Jerusalem three months.” Hebrew (WLC) 24:8: בֶּן־שְׁמֹנֶ֨ה עֶשְׂרֵ֤ה שָׁנָה֙ יְהֹויָכִ֣ין בְּמָלְכֹ֔ו [eighteen years old was Jehoiachin when he became king]. Septuagint (Brenton Greek) 24:8: Υἱὸς ὀκτωκαίδεκα ἐτῶν [eighteen years old]. KJV 2 Chronicles 36:9: “Jehoiachin was eight years old when he began to reign, and he reigned three months and ten days in Jerusalem”. Hebrew (WLC) 2 Chronicles 36:9: בֶּן־שְׁמֹונֶ֤ה שָׁנִים֙ יְהֹויָכִ֣ין בְּמָלְכֹ֔ו [eight years old was Jehoiachin when he became king]. Brenton Greek 2 Chronicles 36:9: Ὀκτὼ ἐτῶν Ἰεχονίας [eight years old was Jechonias]. Fetched from https://bolls.life/get-text/WLC/12/24/, https://ebible.org/grcbrent/2KI24.htm, https://bolls.life/get-text/WLC/14/36/ and https://ebible.org/grcbrent/2CH36.htm.",
