    "text": "KJV 2 Kings 25:8: “And in the fifth month, on the seventh day of the month, which is the nineteenth year of king Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon, came Nebuzaradan, captain of the guard”. Hebrew (WLC) 25:8: וּבַחֹ֤דֶשׁ הַֽחֲמִישִׁי֙ בְּשִׁבְעָ֣ה לַחֹ֔דֶשׁ [and in the fifth month, on the seventh of the month]. Septuagint (Brenton Greek) 25:8: Καὶ ἐν τῷ μηνὶ τῷ πέμπτῳ ἑβδόμῃ τοῦ μηνὸς [and in the fifth month, on the seventh of the month]. KJV Jeremiah 52:12: “Now in the fifth month, in the tenth day of the month, which was the nineteenth year of Nebuchadrezzar king of Babylon, came Nebuzaradan, captain of the guard”. Hebrew (WLC) Jeremiah 52:12: וּבַחֹ֤דֶשׁ הַֽחֲמִישִׁי֙ בֶּעָשֹׂ֣ור לַחֹ֔דֶשׁ [and in the fifth month, on the tenth of the month]. Brenton Greek Jeremiah 52:12: Καὶ ἐν μηνὶ πέμπτῳ, δεκάτῃ τοῦ μηνὸς [and in the fifth month, on the tenth of the month]. Fetched from https://bolls.life/get-text/WLC/12/25/, https://ebible.org/grcbrent/2KI25.htm, https://bolls.life/get-text/WLC/24/52/ and https://ebible.org/grcbrent/JER52.htm.",
