    "text": "KJV 2 Kings 25:19: “and five men of them that were in the king's presence, which were found in the city”. Hebrew (WLC) 25:19: וַחֲמִשָּׁ֨ה אֲנָשִׁ֜ים מֵרֹאֵ֤י פְנֵֽי־הַמֶּ֙לֶךְ֙ [and five men of those who saw the king’s face]. Septuagint (Brenton Greek) 25:19: καὶ πέντε ἄνδρας τῶν ὁρώντων τὸ πρόσωπον τοῦ βασιλέως [and five men of those who saw the face of the king]. KJV Jeremiah 52:25: “and seven men of them that were near the king's person, which were found in the city”. Hebrew (WLC) Jeremiah 52:25: וְשִׁבְעָ֨ה אֲנָשִׁ֜ים מֵרֹאֵ֤י פְנֵי־הַמֶּ֙לֶךְ֙ [and seven men of those who saw the king’s face]. Brenton Greek Jeremiah 52:25: καὶ ἑπτὰ ἄνδρας ὀνομαστοὺς [and seven men of name]. Fetched from https://bolls.life/get-text/WLC/12/25/, https://ebible.org/grcbrent/2KI25.htm, https://bolls.life/get-text/WLC/24/52/ and https://ebible.org/grcbrent/JER52.htm.",
