    "text": "KJV Genesis 4:26: “And to Seth, to him also there was born a son; and he called his name Enos: then began men to call upon the name of the Lord.” Hebrew (WLC) 4:26: אָ֣ז הוּחַ֔ל לִקְרֹ֖א בְּשֵׁ֥ם יְהוָֽה [then it was begun to call on the name of the LORD]. Septuagint (Brenton Greek) 4:26: οὗτος ἤλπισεν ἐπικαλεῖσθαι τὸ ὄνομα Κυρίου τοῦ Θεοῦ [this man hoped to call on the name of the Lord God]. Fetched from https://bolls.life/get-text/WLC/1/4/ and https://ebible.org/grcbrent/GEN04.htm.",
