    "text": "KJV Exodus 15:3: “The Lord is a man of war: the Lord is his name.” Hebrew (WLC) 15:3: יְהוָ֖ה אִ֣ישׁ מִלְחָמָ֑ה [the LORD is a man of war]. Septuagint (Brenton Greek) 15:3: Κύριος συντρίβων πολέμους, Κύριος ὄνομα αὐτῷ [the Lord, crushing wars; the Lord is his name]. Fetched from https://bolls.life/get-text/WLC/2/15/ and https://ebible.org/grcbrent/EXO15.htm.",
