    "text": "KJV Deuteronomy 32:8: “When the Most High divided to the nations their inheritance, when he separated the sons of Adam, he set the bounds of the people according to the number of the children of Israel.” KJV 32:9: “Jacob is the lot of his inheritance” Hebrew (WLC) 32:8: יַצֵּב֙ גְּבֻלֹ֣ת עַמִּ֔ים לְמִסְפַּ֖ר בְּנֵ֥י יִשְׂרָאֵֽל [he set the bounds of peoples to the number of the sons of Israel]. Septuagint (Brenton Greek) 32:8: ἔστησεν ὅρια ἐθνῶν κατὰ ἀριθμὸν ἀγγέλων Θεοῦ [he set the bounds of nations according to the number of the angels of God]. Fetched from https://bolls.life/get-text/WLC/5/32/ and https://ebible.org/grcbrent/DEU32.htm.",
