    "text": "KJV Esther 2:15: “Esther, the daughter of Abihail the uncle of Mordecai” KJV Esther 9:29: “Then Esther the queen, the daughter of Abihail” KJV Esther 2:7: “Esther, his uncle's daughter” Hebrew (WLC) 2:15: אֶסְתֵּ֣ר בַּת־אֲבִיחַ֣יִל דֹּ֣ד מָרְדֳּכַ֡י [Esther daughter of Abihail, uncle of Mordecai]; 9:29: אֶסְתֵּ֨ר הַמַּלְכָּ֧ה בַת־אֲבִיחַ֛יִל [Esther the queen, daughter of Abihail]. Septuagint (Brenton Greek) 2:15: Ἐσθὴρ τῆς θυγατρὸς Ἀμιναδὰβ ἀδελφοῦ πατρὸς Μαρδοχαίου; 9:29: Ἐσθὴρ ἡ βασίλισσα θυγάτηρ Ἀμιναδὰβ; 2:7: θυγάτηρ Ἀμιναδὰβ ἀδελφοῦ πατρὸς αὐτοῦ [daughter of Aminadab, brother of his father]. Fetched from https://bolls.life/get-text/WLC/17/2/, https://bolls.life/get-text/WLC/17/9/, https://ebible.org/grcbrent/ESG02.htm and https://ebible.org/grcbrent/ESG09.htm.",
