    "text": "KJV Job 29:18: “Then I said, I shall die in my nest, and I shall multiply my days as the sand.” Hebrew (WLC) 29:18: וָ֭אֹמַר עִם־קִנִּ֣י אֶגְוָ֑ע וְ֝כַחֹ֗ול אַרְבֶּ֥ה יָמִֽים. Septuagint (Brenton Greek) 29:18: Εἶπα δὲ, ἡ ἡλικία μου γηράσει ὥσπερ στέλεχος φοίνικος, πολὺν χρόνον βιώσω. [And I said, My age shall grow old like the stem of a palm tree; I shall live a long time.] Fetched from https://bolls.life/get-text/WLC/18/29/ and https://ebible.org/grcbrent/JOB29.htm.",
