    "text": "KJV Psalms 45:13: “The king's daughter is all glorious within: her clothing is of wrought gold.” Hebrew (WLC) 45:14: כָּל־כְּבוּדָּ֣ה בַת־מֶ֣לֶךְ פְּנִ֑ימָה. Brenton’s Greek 44:14: Πᾶσα ἡ δόξα αὐτῆς θυγατρὸς τοῦ βασιλέως Ἐσεβὼν [All her glory is of a daughter of the king of Esebon]. Fetched from https://bolls.life/get-text/WLC/19/45/ and https://ebible.org/grcbrent/PSA044.htm.",
