    "text": "KJV Psalms 58:8: “As a snail which melteth, let every one of them pass away: like the untimely birth of a woman, that they may not see the sun.” Hebrew (WLC) 58:9: כְּמֹ֣ו בְּלוּל תֶּ֣מֶס יַהֲלֹ֑ךְ נֵ֥פֶל אֵ֝֗שֶׁת בַּל־חָ֥זוּ שָֽׁמֶשׁ. Brenton’s Greek 57:9: Ὡσεὶ κηρὸς ὁ τακεῖς ἀνταναιρεθήσονται, ἔπεσε πῦρ, καὶ οὐκ εἶδον τὸν ἥλιον [as wax that is melted they shall be taken away; fire fell, and they did not see the sun]. Fetched from https://bolls.life/get-text/WLC/19/58/ and https://ebible.org/grcbrent/PSA057.htm.",
