    "text": "KJV Psalms 62:11: “God hath spoken once; twice have I heard this; that power belongeth unto God.” KJV 62:12: “Also unto thee, O Lord, belongeth mercy” Hebrew (WLC) 62:12: אַחַ֤ת ׀ דִּבֶּ֬ר אֱלֹהִ֗ים שְׁתַּֽיִם־ז֥וּ שָׁמָ֑עְתִּי. Brenton’s Greek 61:12: Ἅπαξ ἐλάλησεν ὁ Θεὸς, δύο ταῦτα ἤκουσα [God has spoken once, two things these I have heard]. Fetched from https://bolls.life/get-text/WLC/19/62/ and https://ebible.org/grcbrent/PSA061.htm.",
