    "text": "KJV Psalms 68:6: “God setteth the solitary in families: he bringeth out those which are bound with chains: but the rebellious dwell in a dry land.” Hebrew (WLC) 68:7: אַ֥ךְ סֹ֝ורֲרִ֗ים שָׁכְנ֥וּ צְחִיחָֽה. Brenton’s Greek 67:7: ὁμοίως τοὺς παραπικραίνοντας, τοὺς κατοικοῦντας ἐν τάφοις [likewise them that provoke, them that dwell in tombs]. Fetched from https://bolls.life/get-text/WLC/19/68/ and https://ebible.org/grcbrent/PSA067.htm.",
