    "text": "KJV Psalms 72:9: “They that dwell in the wilderness shall bow before him; and his enemies shall lick the dust.” Hebrew (WLC) 72:9: לְ֭פָנָיו יִכְרְע֣וּ צִיִּ֑ים וְ֝אֹיְבָ֗יו עָפָ֥ר יְלַחֵֽכוּ. Brenton’s Greek 71:9: Ἐνώπιον αὐτοῦ προπεσοῦνται Αἰθίοπες, καὶ οἱ ἐχθροὶ αὐτοῦ χοῦν λείξουσι [Before him the Ethiopians shall fall down, and his enemies shall lick the dust]. Fetched from https://bolls.life/get-text/WLC/19/72/ and https://ebible.org/grcbrent/PSA071.htm.",
