    "text": "KJV Psalms 91:6: “Nor for the pestilence that walketh in darkness; nor for the destruction that wasteth at noonday.” Hebrew (WLC) 91:6: מִ֝קֶּ֗טֶב יָשׁ֥וּד צָהֳרָֽיִם. Brenton’s Greek 90:6: ἀπὸ συμπτώματος καὶ δαιμονίου μεσημβρινοῦ. Brenton’s own English (https://ebible.org/eng-Brenton/PSA090.htm) prints: “nor of calamity, and the evil spirit at noon-day”. Fetched from https://bolls.life/get-text/WLC/19/91/ and https://ebible.org/grcbrent/PSA090.htm.",
