    "text": "KJV Psalms 104:12: “By them shall the fowls of the heaven have their habitation, which sing among the branches.” Hebrew (WLC) 104:12: מִבֵּ֥ין עֳ֝פָאיִ֗ם יִתְּנוּ־קֹֽול. Brenton’s Greek 103:12: ἐκ μέσου τῶν πετρῶν δώσουσι φωνήν. Brenton’s own English (https://ebible.org/eng-Brenton/PSA103.htm) prints: “out of the midst of the rocks”. Fetched from https://bolls.life/get-text/WLC/19/104/ and https://ebible.org/grcbrent/PSA103.htm.",
