    "text": "KJV Psalms 106:30: “Then stood up Phinehas, and executed judgment: and so the plague was stayed.” Hebrew (WLC) 106:30: וַיַּעֲמֹ֣ד פִּֽ֭ינְחָס וַיְפַלֵּ֑ל. Brenton’s Greek 105:30: Καὶ ἔστη Φινεὲς καὶ ἐξιλάσατο. Brenton’s own English (https://ebible.org/eng-Brenton/PSA105.htm) prints: “Then Phinees stood up, and made atonement”. Fetched from https://bolls.life/get-text/WLC/19/106/ and https://ebible.org/grcbrent/PSA105.htm.",
