    "text": "KJV Psalms 139:20: “For they speak against thee wickedly, and thine enemies take thy name in vain.” Hebrew (WLC) 139:20: נָשֻׂ֖א לַשָּׁ֣וְא עָרֶֽיךָ. Brenton’s Greek 138:20: λήψονται εἰς ματαιότητα τὰς πόλεις σου. Brenton’s own English (https://ebible.org/eng-Brenton/PSA138.htm) prints: “they shall take thy cities in vain”. Fetched from https://bolls.life/get-text/WLC/19/139/ and https://ebible.org/grcbrent/PSA138.htm.",
