    "text": "KJV Psalms 139:23: “Search me, O God, and know my heart: try me, and know my thoughts:” Hebrew (WLC) 139:23: וְדַ֣ע שַׂרְעַפָּֽי. Brenton’s Greek 138:23: γνῶθι τὰς τρίβους μου. Brenton’s own English (https://ebible.org/eng-Brenton/PSA138.htm) prints: “know my paths”. Fetched from https://bolls.life/get-text/WLC/19/139/ and https://ebible.org/grcbrent/PSA138.htm.",
