    "text": "KJV Psalms 144:14: “That our oxen may be strong to labour; that there be no breaking in, nor going out; that there be no complaining in our streets.” Hebrew (WLC) 144:14: אַלּוּפֵ֗ינוּ מְֽסֻבָּ֫לִ֥ים. Brenton’s Greek 143:14: Οἱ βόες αὐτῶν παχεῖς. Brenton’s own English (https://ebible.org/eng-Brenton/PSA143.htm) prints: “Their oxen are fat”. Fetched from https://bolls.life/get-text/WLC/19/144/ and https://ebible.org/grcbrent/PSA143.htm.",
