    "text": "KJV Psalms 145:9: “The Lord is good to all: and his tender mercies are over all his works.” Hebrew (WLC) 145:9: טֹוב־יְהוָ֥ה לַכֹּ֑ל. Brenton’s Greek 144:9: Χρηστὸς Κύριος τοῖς ὑπομένουσι. Brenton’s own English (https://ebible.org/eng-Brenton/PSA144.htm) prints: “The Lord is good to those that wait on him”. Fetched from https://bolls.life/get-text/WLC/19/145/ and https://ebible.org/grcbrent/PSA144.htm.",
